    "one is Helene's OWN national total (truth 228), marked '250' cross-event when that",
    "too is Helene's national figure, and missed Maria's 3,000, the 1916 hurricanes' 80",
    "and a Taiwan typhoon entirely.",
    "",
    "KEY = sha1('<value>|<context lowercased, whitespace collapsed>')[:16], where context",
    "is the same +/-200 char window event_binding_probe.py reads. Keyed on context rather",
    "than on the value so a label survives re-extraction: the feed text is fixed, so the",
    "same figure in the same passage keys identically in any pipeline run.",
    "",
    "labels: helene | cross-event | non-casualty | unclear",
    "'unclear' is a real category, not a dustbin -- two of them are spans the pipeline",
    "emitted that cannot be located in the article text at all."
